As a teenager, I met someone I wanted to know better—but I did not know how to move the conversation beyond hello.

Looking back, it was not only a lack of confidence. Nobody had taught me how to keep a conversation going.

That missed moment is part of why GetToKnow.You exists: conversation is a skill that can be learned, and relationships depend on it.
